1
00:01:32,830 --> 00:01:35,000
[Forging Justice]

2
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:37,770
[Episode 12]

3
00:01:45,350 --> 00:01:45,810
Mentor.

4
00:01:46,509 --> 00:01:47,840
I just finished reading

5
00:01:47,950 --> 00:01:49,009
Wang Youxi's case.

6
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,030
It's too egregious.

7
00:01:50,030 --> 00:01:51,120
He molested a woman in the street,

8
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:51,750
in front of her husband

9
00:01:51,750 --> 00:01:52,350
and son.

10
00:01:52,750 --> 00:01:55,030
If we let him get away with this,
he'll never stop.

11
00:01:55,030 --> 00:01:55,960
So fired up, huh?

12
00:01:58,030 --> 00:01:59,890
You've been here for three years,

13
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,480
and this is your first time
as the lead prosecutor.

14
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:03,430
It's natural to get invested in a case.

15
00:02:03,430 --> 00:02:05,430
But you have to keep reminding yourself:

16
00:02:05,430 --> 00:02:06,950
Be committed,
but don't get personally entangled.

17
00:02:06,950 --> 00:02:08,470
Because we are prosecutors,

18
00:02:08,470 --> 00:02:09,800
not ordinary citizens.

19
00:02:10,470 --> 00:02:11,360
I understand.

20
00:02:11,710 --> 00:02:12,930
-But this case...
-Chen, someone is looking for you.

21
00:02:12,930 --> 00:02:13,730
Just a minute.

22
00:02:14,310 --> 00:02:15,170
Okay, go ahead.

23
00:02:15,710 --> 00:02:16,640
I'll take a look.

24
00:02:17,470 --> 00:02:17,870
Okay.

25
00:02:24,810 --> 00:02:29,750
[Citizen Reception Office,
Binjiang City People's Procuratorate]

26
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:28,800
Chen,

27
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,440
going out?

28
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:33,630
Hey buddy!

29
00:02:35,190 --> 00:02:36,450
Need to file a lawsuit?

30
00:02:36,860 --> 00:02:37,680
Need a legal petition written?

31
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:38,610
Don't yell here.

32
00:02:39,630 --> 00:02:40,400
When did you get here?

33
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,190
I just arrived.

34
00:02:41,190 --> 00:02:42,450
I was on a business trip to Bindong.

35
00:02:42,450 --> 00:02:44,310
I came here especially to see you.

36
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,890
Looking at your outfit,

37
00:02:46,660 --> 00:02:48,280
you look more and more like a profiteer.

38
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:48,840
Oh, man.

39
00:02:49,660 --> 00:02:51,790
Aren't you going to find me a good seat?

40
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,500
I earned a lot of money,

41
00:02:54,300 --> 00:02:55,560
but didn't save a dime.

42
00:02:56,240 --> 00:02:57,120
I'm like a guy with a rake

43
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,610
pulling in cash,

44
00:02:58,710 --> 00:02:59,360
but right behind me there's

45
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,800
someone scattering it all away.

46
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:01,280
Who?

47
00:03:01,750 --> 00:03:02,480
Yuan Yifang,

48
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,780
the great lawyer Yuan.

49
00:03:04,150 --> 00:03:06,000
Chivalrous, pure-hearted—

50
00:03:06,020 --> 00:03:06,970
people call him

51
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:09,330
the "Never-Winning Wealth-Scatterer."

52
00:03:10,430 --> 00:03:12,030
I'm here burning the midnight oil,

53
00:03:12,030 --> 00:03:13,150
bringing in the business,

54
00:03:13,150 --> 00:03:14,380
and he's out there taking on

55
00:03:14,380 --> 00:03:15,520
pro bono cases left and right.

56
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,680
You know what we call that?

57
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,880
A total waste of time.

58
00:03:18,190 --> 00:03:19,280
Our law firm

59
00:03:19,310 --> 00:03:20,840
can barely keep going now,

60
00:03:20,870 --> 00:03:22,530
which is already pretty good.

61
00:03:22,710 --> 00:03:24,510
You don't need to complain to me.

62
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:25,310
If you don't want to do it,

63
00:03:25,310 --> 00:03:26,640
just don't work for him.

64
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:28,470
People

65
00:03:28,870 --> 00:03:30,400
shouldn't just care about money.

66
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,960
We need to have some pursuits, right?

67
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,490
See, you still want to do it.

68
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:34,960
Okay.

69
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,490
It's good to have him keep you in check.

70
00:03:39,150 --> 00:03:40,120
Wait a moment.

71
00:03:40,150 --> 00:03:40,800
After I get off work,

72
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,660
let's go grab some food.

73
00:03:41,660 --> 00:03:43,070
I've already booked a private room.

74
00:03:43,070 --> 00:03:44,240
Let's invite Xia Yingjie

75
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,030
and Yu Gaoyuan

76
00:03:45,030 --> 00:03:45,650
tonight.

77
00:03:46,430 --> 00:03:47,760
Especially Yu Gaoyuan.

78
00:03:48,190 --> 00:03:49,150
There's something

79
00:03:49,150 --> 00:03:50,950
I need to talk to that jerk about.

80
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,140
What did he do this time?

81
00:03:52,140 --> 00:03:54,140
I ran into Zhang Lihui a few days ago.

82
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:57,310
I heard she is studying
for her master's degree

83
00:03:57,310 --> 00:03:58,770
under Mr. Zhou, isn't she?

84
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,320
She's not doing well.

85
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:03,150
Very badly.

86
00:04:07,550 --> 00:04:08,960
Chief Judge, you were looking for me?

87
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:09,360
Xia.

88
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,360
Come, come in.

89
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,610
I'll close the door.

90
00:04:18,950 --> 00:04:19,480
No need.

91
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:20,600
Come, sit.

92
00:04:25,070 --> 00:04:26,070
Here's the thing.

93
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:28,710
The division is planning

94
00:04:29,130 --> 00:04:30,950
to transfer you to Mei Fang's team.

95
00:04:30,950 --> 00:04:31,870
Any objections?

96
00:04:31,870 --> 00:04:32,510
Why?

97
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,510
Mei Fang has had a hard life.

98
00:04:34,510 --> 00:04:36,150
Her husband just passed away
from an illness.

99
00:04:36,150 --> 00:04:38,480
She's only been back at work
for two years.

100
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:40,340
Her skills aren't quite up to par.

101
00:04:40,630 --> 00:04:43,159
We're transferring you there
to help her out.

102
00:04:43,430 --> 00:04:45,630
Didn't Mei go to college back in the day?

103
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:46,920
I remember

104
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:48,270
she graduated from Dongdu University
of Political Science and Law.

105
00:04:48,270 --> 00:04:49,130
What's the use?

106
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,620
She's out of practice.

107
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,510
Years ago,

108
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,280
she got dragged down

109
00:04:54,310 --> 00:04:56,070
by her husband's political issues

110
00:04:56,070 --> 00:04:57,830
and was sent down to do accounting.

111
00:04:57,830 --> 00:04:59,830
She barely spent any time as a judge.

112
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,330
Back then,

113
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,950
the division sent Sun over.

114
00:05:02,950 --> 00:05:05,040
But this guy is too blunt.

115
00:05:05,750 --> 00:05:08,310
And Mei Fang is quite sensitive.

116
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,050
The two of them often...

117
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:11,680
Got it.

118
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:13,800
Got it.

119
00:05:15,090 --> 00:05:16,090
But, Chief Judge,

120
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,920
I'm even blunter than Sun.

121
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,680
Are you alright?

122
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,310
I'm fine.

123
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,800
Ate too fast at lunch.

124
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:26,880
Feeling a bit queasy.

125
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:30,870
Xia.

126
00:05:31,630 --> 00:05:33,560
The division is in a tough spot now.

127
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,390
We don't feel comfortable

128
00:05:35,390 --> 00:05:36,590
giving her big cases.

129
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:38,600
But if we always give her small cases,

130
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,800
she's not satisfied.

131
00:05:40,070 --> 00:05:42,510
She has repeatedly
approached the leadership,

132
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:43,270
asking if the division

133
00:05:43,270 --> 00:05:44,430
doesn't trust her.

134
00:05:45,150 --> 00:05:46,810
What do you think we should do?

135
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:47,920
Well,

136
00:05:48,650 --> 00:05:50,050
what do you want me to say?

137
00:05:50,290 --> 00:05:52,000
Just say that you'll definitely

138
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,730
help Mei Fang professionally,

139
00:05:54,070 --> 00:05:56,000
and that you'll mind your methods—

140
00:05:56,070 --> 00:05:58,070
protecting Mei Fang's self-esteem

141
00:05:58,310 --> 00:06:00,120
while making sure the work is solid.

142
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,360
Say, ''Chief Judge, don't worry.

143
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,290
Leave it to me.''

144
00:06:03,830 --> 00:06:04,560
Is that okay?

145
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:14,630
Such a trivial case.

146
00:06:14,630 --> 00:06:15,830
Dragged from the first instance
all the way to appeal.

147
00:06:15,830 --> 00:06:16,600
Assault, minor injuries,

148
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,560
and they give him three years—

149
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,820
the maximum sentence.

150
00:06:18,950 --> 00:06:21,010
Yet the family is still making a fuss.

151
00:06:21,070 --> 00:06:21,480
Xia.

152
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:24,270
Threatening suicide, filing petitions...

153
00:06:24,270 --> 00:06:25,000
If you ask me,

154
00:06:25,130 --> 00:06:26,660
we should just ignore them.

155
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:30,020
I'm done. Take your time.

156
00:06:30,020 --> 00:06:31,010
Okay.

157
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:38,310
Yu,

158
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:40,500
I was just looking for you.

159
00:06:40,870 --> 00:06:43,200
There is a letter for you
at the gatehouse.

160
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:43,800
He said it's been there

161
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,600
for over a month,

162
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,510
and you didn't go get it.

163
00:06:45,510 --> 00:06:46,730
He asked me to bring it to you.

164
00:06:46,730 --> 00:06:48,980
[Recipient: Yu Gaoyuan
Sender: Zhang Lihui]

165
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,180
You owe me a meal later.

166
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:50,000
Thanks.

167
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,600
This name is a girl.

168
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,270
Not bad, Yu.

169
00:07:08,070 --> 00:07:09,270
High standards, huh?

170
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,510
From the Supreme People's Procuratorate,

171
00:07:10,510 --> 00:07:12,240
and you can't even be bothered?

172
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:15,360
Does it have anything to do with you?

173
00:07:20,310 --> 00:07:21,110
Just kidding.

174
00:07:22,430 --> 00:07:23,630
She was my classmate.

175
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:28,770
You're back.

176
00:07:28,770 --> 00:07:29,180
Yes.

177
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:08,580
Mentor.

178
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,400
Look at these.

179
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:11,600
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

180
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,480
Careful, it is so hot.

181
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:12,870
Have a seat.

182
00:08:12,870 --> 00:08:14,120
You're so clumsy.

183
00:08:14,430 --> 00:08:15,230
What's wrong?

184
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:17,410
Look at these hearings we've held.

185
00:08:17,830 --> 00:08:19,030
Dozens of defendants

186
00:08:19,070 --> 00:08:20,120
all mentioned someone

187
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,240
named Xiaoguang.

188
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,270
He must be

189
00:08:22,270 --> 00:08:24,400
the ringleader of this hooligan gang.

190
00:08:24,570 --> 00:08:26,170
But look at this indictment.

191
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:28,800
His name wasn't

192
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,800
mentioned at all.

193
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,530
So what are you suggesting?

194
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,390
It's not about what I'm suggesting.

195
00:08:33,390 --> 00:08:34,650
We have to root him out.

196
00:08:35,750 --> 00:08:36,549
For this case,

197
00:08:36,669 --> 00:08:38,360
we only try

198
00:08:38,390 --> 00:08:39,740
what the procuratorate submits.

199
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:40,470
Why?

200
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:43,909
No, Mentor.

201
00:08:43,909 --> 00:08:44,860
Such an important

202
00:08:44,860 --> 00:08:46,060
hooligan gang crime,

203
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,600
with dozens of female victims,

204
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,200
including minors

205
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:48,750
and even suicides—

206
00:08:48,750 --> 00:08:50,610
no matter how we rule, we can't...

207
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:53,360
No.

208
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,480
I'm worried that when they investigate
for accountability,

209
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:55,480
it will fall on us.

210
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,600
Look at what's written here.

211
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,770
Xiaoguang instigated it all.

212
00:08:57,770 --> 00:08:59,020
We were just following orders.

213
00:08:59,020 --> 00:08:59,810
Whatever he told us to do,

214
00:08:59,810 --> 00:09:00,200
we did.

215
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:00,960
Excuse me.

216
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:02,420
That's what they all said.

217
00:09:09,510 --> 00:09:10,440
Song Xiaoguang.

218
00:09:10,630 --> 00:09:12,490
This is Xiaoguang you mentioned.

219
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,120
Manic psychosis?

220
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,120
Let me tell you.

221
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,390
Why didn't the procuratorate

222
00:09:22,390 --> 00:09:24,390
mention it in the indictment?

223
00:09:24,870 --> 00:09:26,670
Because they can't.

224
00:09:26,850 --> 00:09:28,080
You think you're the only one who noticed?

225
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,940
You think everyone else is blind?

226
00:09:30,150 --> 00:09:31,480
This evaluation report

227
00:09:31,630 --> 00:09:32,770
came with the case file

228
00:09:32,770 --> 00:09:33,770
when it was transferred.

229
00:09:33,770 --> 00:09:34,320
Then this evaluation report

230
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,320
must have issues.

231
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:36,240
He's currently

232
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:38,240
staying in a psychiatric hospital,

233
00:09:38,390 --> 00:09:39,510
in a private ward.

234
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:43,320
That's already
doing the procuratorate a favor.

235
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,520
Wait, who is this guy?

236
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,120
You know the "Song"

237
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:49,500
in Song Xiaoguang?

238
00:09:50,150 --> 00:09:51,350
It's the Song family.

239
00:09:52,220 --> 00:09:53,470
Silly boy.

240
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,050
Song Xiaoguang,

241
00:10:14,270 --> 00:10:14,960
right?

242
00:10:16,510 --> 00:10:17,370
How do you know?

243
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,840
Who doesn't know?

244
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,670
Everybody in Binjiang knows.

245
00:10:20,670 --> 00:10:21,440
Except you.

246
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,010
What do you mean?

247
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:26,080
That's Deputy Secretary Song's son.

248
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:28,280
The infamous crown prince of Binjiang.

249
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:29,150
You...

250
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:30,810
Wasting my time,

251
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:33,360
right?

252
00:10:33,830 --> 00:10:34,560
Absolutely.

253
00:10:35,630 --> 00:10:37,890
Mr. Song started his career in Binjiang.

254
00:10:38,030 --> 00:10:39,550
More than half of the city's officials

255
00:10:39,550 --> 00:10:41,210
are his former subordinates.

256
00:10:41,510 --> 00:10:43,360
If you want to prosecute his only son,

257
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:45,820
you'd better weigh the consequences first.

258
00:10:50,910 --> 00:10:51,970
Hello, who's this?

259
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,180
It's Chen Yizhong.

260
00:10:53,790 --> 00:10:55,030
Yizhong. What's up?

261
00:10:57,800 --> 00:10:59,330
Are you free tonight?

262
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,960
Let's have dinner together.

263
00:11:01,550 --> 00:11:03,600
What's the catch for this sudden treat?

264
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:05,130
Is there something urgent?

265
00:11:05,670 --> 00:11:06,800
No, nothing urgent.

266
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:07,440
Well,

267
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,080
Lu Zeming is here.

268
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:12,480
Okay, I'll go. Let's bleed him dry.

269
00:11:13,390 --> 00:11:13,790
Okay.

270
00:11:14,670 --> 00:11:15,150
Also,

271
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:17,360
Yu might come too.

272
00:11:19,330 --> 00:11:20,160
Whatever.

273
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:28,860
You are here so early.

274
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:31,620
Great Prosecutor Chen.

275
00:11:31,910 --> 00:11:33,000
Great Judge.

276
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:34,570
You're even reading at dinner?

277
00:11:34,570 --> 00:11:35,510
Of course.

278
00:11:35,790 --> 00:11:37,600
How long has it been since we last met?

279
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:39,240
The last time was

280
00:11:39,510 --> 00:11:40,110
in spring,

281
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:41,370
the tug-of-war.

282
00:11:41,910 --> 00:11:42,360
Right.

283
00:11:42,870 --> 00:11:44,290
Yu led those beefy guys

284
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:45,290
from your court

285
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,840
and almost pulled me away.

286
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:48,320
That's because you have no principles.

287
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:50,200
You switch sides
as soon as someone wins you over.

288
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,200
Who switched sides?

289
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:52,800
When did I ever switch sides?

290
00:11:54,330 --> 00:11:55,550
Are you two really that busy?

291
00:11:55,550 --> 00:11:56,690
Our courts are right next to each other,

292
00:11:56,690 --> 00:11:58,630
but we haven't seen each other all year.

293
00:11:58,630 --> 00:11:59,670
I'm alright. I'm not that busy.

294
00:11:59,670 --> 00:12:01,200
Xia Yingjie's the busy one.

295
00:12:01,270 --> 00:12:02,960
Running down all day long.

296
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:05,440
Isn't your Intermediate Court mainly

297
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:06,670
responsible for second instance trials?

298
00:12:06,670 --> 00:12:07,630
Why are you running down?

299
00:12:07,630 --> 00:12:09,940
The criminal division is especially busy.

300
00:12:09,940 --> 00:12:11,370
Our chief judge always says,

301
00:12:11,370 --> 00:12:13,000
''We're not some grassroots court.

302
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:15,200
We handle only the most serious cases."

303
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:17,060
So basically, for every case,

304
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:19,720
we have to interrogate
and investigate personally.

305
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:21,030
But shouldn't that be the job
of the police

306
00:12:21,030 --> 00:12:22,630
and your procuratorate?

307
00:12:23,150 --> 00:12:23,630
Right.

308
00:12:23,870 --> 00:12:25,070
Ask your chief judge.

309
00:12:26,220 --> 00:12:27,320
Their chief judge is a bit

310
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,970
like that Mentor in Nanyu.

311
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:29,870
Who? Zhang?

312
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:31,670
Their chief judge was transferred

313
00:12:31,670 --> 00:12:32,910
from your procuratorate.

314
00:12:32,910 --> 00:12:34,320
He has

315
00:12:34,630 --> 00:12:35,560
an instinctive,

316
00:12:35,870 --> 00:12:36,630
immense,

317
00:12:36,790 --> 00:12:37,840
and infinite passion
for investigating cases.

318
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:39,100
Occupational hazard.

319
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,130
Yizhong.

320
00:12:40,390 --> 00:12:41,960
The judge still has to

321
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,320
investigate the case.

322
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,240
Do you think that is right?

323
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,270
In our country's current situation,

324
00:12:45,270 --> 00:12:46,200
I think it's necessary.

325
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,270
Because in my ideal world,

326
00:12:47,270 --> 00:12:48,870
a judge's state should be:

327
00:12:49,270 --> 00:12:51,360
barely look at the case files
before going to court,

328
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,150
then in court,

329
00:12:52,150 --> 00:12:53,630
just listen to both sides,

330
00:12:53,630 --> 00:12:55,430
and making a ruling right there.

331
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,210
Didn't he just say it?

332
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,600
At this stage,

333
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,900
it's hard to be so idealistic.

334
00:13:04,930 --> 00:13:05,930
And it's not just

335
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,720
demanding for you personally.

336
00:13:07,870 --> 00:13:09,150
It has high requirements

337
00:13:09,150 --> 00:13:10,480
from both the prosecution and defense.

338
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:11,030
True.

339
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,030
Very true.

340
00:13:13,150 --> 00:13:13,630
Look.

341
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:16,290
The same words, but coming from you

342
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:17,210
versus me...

343
00:13:23,860 --> 00:13:24,700
Waiter!

344
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:27,300
Hello. Where is...

345
00:13:33,490 --> 00:13:35,550
Thought you'd chicken out
to avoid an expensive bill.

346
00:13:35,550 --> 00:13:36,870
Excuse me, is this

347
00:13:36,910 --> 00:13:38,970
the private room for the chosen ones?

348
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,480
Come on, friends.

349
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:42,930
Never fight an unprepared battle.

350
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:43,630
Spend away!

351
00:13:43,630 --> 00:13:44,630
Chen Yizhong, you order.

352
00:13:44,630 --> 00:13:45,790
Order the most expensive one.

353
00:13:45,790 --> 00:13:46,910
Don't save money

354
00:13:46,910 --> 00:13:47,720
for our Dafang Law Firm.

355
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:48,750
Otherwise it'll just get

356
00:13:48,750 --> 00:13:50,280
squandered by Yuan anyway.

357
00:13:51,690 --> 00:13:53,790
Let's ask someone who knows how to order.

358
00:13:53,790 --> 00:13:54,120
Okay.

359
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:54,960
Gaoyuan!

360
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:56,510
Yu Gaoyuan!

361
00:13:56,750 --> 00:13:57,630
Come on.

362
00:13:57,650 --> 00:13:58,200
Long time no see.

363
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:58,840
You remember me, huh?

364
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:00,160
Yu Gaoyuan.

365
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,750
Long time no see.

366
00:14:01,910 --> 00:14:02,510
You, great lawyer,

367
00:14:02,510 --> 00:14:03,080
came here

368
00:14:03,100 --> 00:14:04,100
to guide our work?

369
00:14:04,720 --> 00:14:06,240
I'm here to talk business with you.

370
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,120
Are you kidding me?

371
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:08,350
I'd have to take off my uniform.

372
00:14:08,350 --> 00:14:09,480
Why are you still like that?

373
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:10,550
Still so touchy.

374
00:14:10,790 --> 00:14:11,200
Sit down.

375
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:12,460
Just messing with you.

376
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:13,910
I'm doing

377
00:14:13,910 --> 00:14:14,670
non-litigation work now.

378
00:14:14,670 --> 00:14:16,620
Who would want to be a criminal defender?

379
00:14:16,620 --> 00:14:18,080
All that work and no money.

380
00:14:19,750 --> 00:14:21,320
Tonight,

381
00:14:22,030 --> 00:14:22,440
Yu Gaoyuan,

382
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:24,240
let's really tie one on tonight,

383
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:26,410
and have a proper heart-to-heart.

384
00:14:26,750 --> 00:14:27,910
Okay, have a proper heart-to-heart.

385
00:14:27,910 --> 00:14:29,040
But I quit drinking.

386
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,130
Why did you quit?

387
00:14:30,140 --> 00:14:31,730
Why didn't you quit earlier?

388
00:14:31,730 --> 00:14:32,720
Sir, take a look at this.

389
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:34,600
Four catties and seven taels,
is this okay?

390
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:35,130
How much?

391
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:37,750
Who is so thoughtful?

392
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:38,710
Me.

393
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:40,030
Xia.

394
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:42,030
Serve it.

395
00:14:42,550 --> 00:14:43,150
Hurry up.

396
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:44,300
Take your seat.

397
00:14:44,510 --> 00:14:45,360
Sure.

398
00:14:53,790 --> 00:14:55,520
What's your name, sweetheart?

399
00:14:55,630 --> 00:14:56,440
Xiaohong.

400
00:14:56,630 --> 00:14:57,720
Right, Xiaohong.

401
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,120
I'm not dancing.

402
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,750
Come on, let's dance.

403
00:15:06,770 --> 00:15:07,420
Come on.

404
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:09,600
Come on.

405
00:15:12,190 --> 00:15:12,550
Shake it.

406
00:15:12,550 --> 00:15:14,210
I thought you loved drinking?

407
00:15:15,270 --> 00:15:16,510
You don't wanna drink? Drink up!

408
00:15:16,510 --> 00:15:17,030
Come on,

409
00:15:17,150 --> 00:15:18,000
let's shake it.

410
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:18,530
Shake it.

411
00:15:28,510 --> 00:15:29,110
All right.

412
00:15:29,150 --> 00:15:29,910
Sure.

413
00:15:29,910 --> 00:15:30,910
Shake it.

414
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:53,000
I'm tired. I'm going back first.

415
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:55,020
Aren't you leaving with them?

416
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:57,900
I'm off.

417
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:14,270
Stop dancing. Let's go back.

418
00:16:14,270 --> 00:16:15,870
Let's dance a little longer.

419
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:18,800
Now you don't want to drink?

420
00:16:19,670 --> 00:16:20,750
You don't wanna have a few drinks

421
00:16:20,750 --> 00:16:22,610
and do something reckless again?

422
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:24,630
What?

423
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:29,150
I saw Zhang Lihui a few days ago

424
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:30,370
at Mr. Zhou's house.

425
00:16:31,670 --> 00:16:32,320
How is she?

426
00:16:33,950 --> 00:16:34,960
Did you know

427
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:37,490
she's become kinda withdrawn
and closed off?

428
00:16:38,150 --> 00:16:39,080
What do you mean?

429
00:16:39,670 --> 00:16:41,240
Ask yourself.

430
00:16:43,500 --> 00:16:44,200
Ask myself what?

431
00:16:44,200 --> 00:16:46,130
We lost contact after graduation.

432
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:50,360
What happened between me and Zhang Lihui

433
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:51,760
is none of your business.

434
00:16:54,040 --> 00:16:54,550
Yu Gaoyuan,

435
00:16:54,550 --> 00:16:56,410
can you talk like a normal person?

436
00:16:58,790 --> 00:16:59,510
Mr. Lu.

437
00:16:59,510 --> 00:17:00,720
What do you want me to say?

438
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:02,050
What do you want to hear?

439
00:17:07,790 --> 00:17:09,160
I want to slap you.

440
00:17:09,440 --> 00:17:10,589
Can you beat me?

441
00:17:13,349 --> 00:17:14,109
Let's try.

442
00:17:15,310 --> 00:17:16,069
Try it.

443
00:17:17,589 --> 00:17:18,750
Can I beat you?

444
00:17:18,900 --> 00:17:19,510
It's fine.

445
00:17:21,109 --> 00:17:22,170
You drank too much.

446
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:23,000
Hit me.

447
00:17:23,030 --> 00:17:23,790
Hit me!

448
00:17:23,810 --> 00:17:24,410
All right.

449
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:25,770
You've had too much?

450
00:17:25,829 --> 00:17:27,359
I'll tell you one last time:

451
00:17:28,270 --> 00:17:29,750
What's between me and Zhang Lihui

452
00:17:29,750 --> 00:17:31,150
is none of your business.

453
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:32,240
You're drunk. Let's drop it.

454
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:33,030
Go sit down.

455
00:17:34,790 --> 00:17:36,080
Now that you've made money,

456
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:36,970
eaten lobster,

457
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:37,930
and put on a suit,

458
00:17:39,110 --> 00:17:40,800
you're acting all high and mighty
in front of old classmates.

459
00:17:40,800 --> 00:17:41,750
You're drunk. Enough.

460
00:17:41,750 --> 00:17:42,310
Go back and sit down.

461
00:17:42,310 --> 00:17:42,830
Let's go.

462
00:17:42,830 --> 00:17:43,490
Go sit down.

463
00:17:45,750 --> 00:17:46,260
Chen Yizhong,

464
00:17:46,260 --> 00:17:48,190
I'm telling you right here and now:

465
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:50,640
I'm officially falling out

466
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:51,570
with Yu Gaoyuan.

467
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:54,350
Not that we were ever close anyway.

468
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:56,660
You're really like this, huh.

469
00:18:10,790 --> 00:18:11,830
Where is Xia Yingjie?

470
00:18:11,830 --> 00:18:12,360
She left.

471
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:19,350
None of you

472
00:18:19,350 --> 00:18:20,410
think highly of me.

473
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:27,300
You brought this on yourself.

474
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:28,480
Who can you blame?

475
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,170
I drank too much,

476
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:34,640
lost control,

477
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:35,750
and kissed her. So what?

478
00:18:35,750 --> 00:18:36,880
Now the rest of my life

479
00:18:36,880 --> 00:18:37,640
is about paying for that.

480
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:39,240
I'm not doing anything else.

481
00:18:42,070 --> 00:18:42,750
She wrote letters to me.

482
00:18:42,750 --> 00:18:43,640
I never replied to a single one.

483
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:44,530
Doesn't that show my stance?

484
00:18:44,530 --> 00:18:45,400
I don't want to affect

485
00:18:45,400 --> 00:18:46,310
or interfere with her life.

486
00:18:46,310 --> 00:18:47,110
What do I need to do now

487
00:18:47,110 --> 00:18:48,170
to satisfy you all?

488
00:18:48,530 --> 00:18:49,610
You made a mistake,

489
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:50,960
yet you ignore her.

490
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:53,030
And you're arguing with me here.

491
00:18:53,030 --> 00:18:54,590
Shouldn't you give her an explanation?

492
00:18:54,590 --> 00:18:56,200
Have you said a single word
to her to this day?

493
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:58,000
All she wants is an explanation.

494
00:18:58,030 --> 00:18:59,240
Ignoring her isn't a stance.

495
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:00,300
It's running away.

496
00:19:03,070 --> 00:19:04,670
Same thing with Xia Yingjie.

497
00:19:04,760 --> 00:19:06,270
You two are in the same workplace,
and you can't even

498
00:19:06,270 --> 00:19:07,050
exchange a word.

499
00:19:07,050 --> 00:19:07,730
Why?

500
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:09,270
I...

501
00:19:10,680 --> 00:19:12,810
Does she ever even look at me properly?

502
00:19:14,790 --> 00:19:15,920
Xia Yingjie and I...

503
00:19:16,170 --> 00:19:17,000
She's unhappy right now.

504
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:18,050
She needs company and is lonely.

505
00:19:18,050 --> 00:19:18,850
Why don't you go?

506
00:19:18,850 --> 00:19:19,890
Don't run away.

507
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:52,400
Yingjie,

508
00:19:53,270 --> 00:19:55,130
I hope this letter finds you well.

509
00:19:55,590 --> 00:19:56,750
Did you get the package

510
00:19:56,750 --> 00:19:57,680
I sent you?

511
00:19:58,830 --> 00:20:00,690
There's nothing special inside.

512
00:20:01,750 --> 00:20:03,680
Just salted duck eggs, dried meat,

513
00:20:04,030 --> 00:20:04,880
and salted fish

514
00:20:04,880 --> 00:20:05,940
from our hometown.

515
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:07,640
They are all things you liked to eat

516
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:08,840
when you were a child.

517
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:11,320
I don't know if you

518
00:20:11,350 --> 00:20:13,000
still like them now.

519
00:20:14,030 --> 00:20:15,400
Time flies.

520
00:20:16,680 --> 00:20:18,010
It feels like yesterday

521
00:20:18,030 --> 00:20:20,070
you were still a naive little girl.

522
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:22,070
And now,

523
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:25,280
you've been working in Binjiang
for so many years.

524
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:28,000
I'm so proud of you, my daughter.

525
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:31,480
I'm genuinely happy for everything
you've achieved.

526
00:20:31,720 --> 00:20:32,510
But still,

527
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:34,440
I can't help but worry

528
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:36,480
about you.

529
00:20:37,550 --> 00:20:38,880
Living alone out there,

530
00:20:39,070 --> 00:20:40,070
in life

531
00:20:40,270 --> 00:20:40,930
and at work,

532
00:20:41,750 --> 00:20:44,150
I'm sure you've faced plenty of hardships.

533
00:20:45,350 --> 00:20:46,350
My sweet daughter.

534
00:20:46,350 --> 00:20:46,830
Morning.

535
00:20:46,830 --> 00:20:47,360
Morning.

536
00:20:47,510 --> 00:20:48,640
I miss you.

537
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:58,030
Mei.

538
00:20:58,070 --> 00:20:59,590
The chief judge told me to report to you

539
00:20:59,590 --> 00:21:00,990
as your assistant judge.

540
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:04,550
Come in.

541
00:21:07,790 --> 00:21:09,270
I don't have much experience.

542
00:21:09,270 --> 00:21:11,240
Please correct me if I make mistakes

543
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:12,070
without holding back.

544
00:21:12,070 --> 00:21:14,270
The chief judge is really
looking out for me.

545
00:21:14,270 --> 00:21:16,030
Knowing my professional skills
aren't up to par,

546
00:21:16,030 --> 00:21:17,110
he sent a talented student

547
00:21:17,110 --> 00:21:17,830
to tutor me.

548
00:21:18,350 --> 00:21:19,680
Please don't say that.

549
00:21:20,030 --> 00:21:21,310
Whether it's life experience

550
00:21:21,310 --> 00:21:22,310
or professional qualifications,

551
00:21:22,310 --> 00:21:23,370
I'm way behind you.

552
00:21:29,030 --> 00:21:29,920
Can I sit here?

553
00:21:30,550 --> 00:21:31,080
Go ahead.

554
00:21:37,680 --> 00:21:38,950
It's all thanks to you

555
00:21:39,250 --> 00:21:39,830
that I get to enjoy

556
00:21:39,830 --> 00:21:41,230
this two-person office.

557
00:21:41,960 --> 00:21:42,820
What about Sun?

558
00:21:43,240 --> 00:21:44,920
Was he transferred to your department?

559
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:45,310
Yes.

560
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:47,370
That's good.

561
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:50,110
He's outgoing and likes to chat.

562
00:21:50,110 --> 00:21:52,310
It's a great fit for him to be over there.

563
00:21:53,270 --> 00:21:54,870
He said he misses being here.

564
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:57,400
What's there to miss?

565
00:21:57,750 --> 00:21:59,510
There are no big cases here,

566
00:21:59,590 --> 00:22:01,290
just trivial matters all day.

567
00:22:02,510 --> 00:22:03,440
When you get old,

568
00:22:03,960 --> 00:22:04,920
even dogs despise you,

569
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:06,590
and the leaders don't care about you.

570
00:22:06,590 --> 00:22:07,880
Now that you're with me,

571
00:22:07,880 --> 00:22:09,610
you'll have to put up with a lot.

572
00:22:10,230 --> 00:22:11,170
Don't say that.

573
00:22:11,200 --> 00:22:13,800
In our criminal division,
every case matters.

574
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:15,960
If it's not a life sentence
or the death penalty,

575
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:17,400
it wouldn't be sent
to the Intermediate Court.

576
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:18,000
Right?

577
00:22:26,550 --> 00:22:27,610
How dare you hit me!

578
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:28,880
Let go of my mom!

579
00:22:30,620 --> 00:22:32,470
Let me go! Let me go!

580
00:22:32,500 --> 00:22:33,830
You stole our business.

581
00:22:35,220 --> 00:22:37,370
Mom, stop fighting! Let's go home!

582
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:38,440
Stop fighting!

583
00:22:42,110 --> 00:22:42,830
Mom!

584
00:22:49,680 --> 00:22:52,440
You are a bourgeois capitalist roader,

585
00:22:53,350 --> 00:22:54,780
wearing this thing around your neck.

586
00:22:54,780 --> 00:22:56,250
Mom! Mom!

587
00:22:58,440 --> 00:23:00,040
You're a capitalist roader.

588
00:23:08,720 --> 00:23:09,720
Pick it up and put it on!

589
00:23:09,720 --> 00:23:11,440
Let go of my mom!

590
00:23:11,640 --> 00:23:13,030
Let me go!

591
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:14,490
Yizhong!

592
00:23:15,260 --> 00:23:16,140
Shut up!

593
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:44,080
See? Aren't they beasts?

594
00:23:47,400 --> 00:23:49,220
What do you think of the evidence?

595
00:23:49,220 --> 00:23:50,820
The evidence is conclusive.

596
00:23:51,830 --> 00:23:53,550
These people, even now,

597
00:23:53,720 --> 00:23:55,110
still don't think
they've committed a crime

598
00:23:55,110 --> 00:23:56,480
and spout self-righteous nonsense.

599
00:23:56,480 --> 00:23:57,940
The confessions match up.

600
00:23:58,000 --> 00:23:59,680
And there are many witnesses at the scene.

601
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:02,200
Over a hundred bystanders
watched it happen,

602
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:03,310
and the victim's injury report

603
00:24:03,310 --> 00:24:04,170
is already out.

604
00:24:05,110 --> 00:24:07,440
Tian Shuzhen isn't just physically hurt—

605
00:24:07,690 --> 00:24:08,830
she's also suffered severe

606
00:24:08,830 --> 00:24:10,160
psychological trauma.

607
00:24:11,310 --> 00:24:12,240
Then there's no problem.

608
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:13,440
Just prosecute them.

609
00:24:13,590 --> 00:24:14,000
Yes.

610
00:24:14,510 --> 00:24:15,400
I'm going to the scene

611
00:24:15,400 --> 00:24:16,270
to investigate again.

612
00:24:16,270 --> 00:24:18,310
Make sure the case file is bulletproof.

613
00:24:18,310 --> 00:24:19,030
Your case file

614
00:24:19,030 --> 00:24:20,110
is already very solid.

615
00:24:20,110 --> 00:24:21,170
Is that necessary?

616
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:24,550
I want to ask those people

617
00:24:24,550 --> 00:24:25,950
what they were thinking.

618
00:24:27,550 --> 00:24:29,080
Chen, I've told you before.

619
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:30,720
A case to a prosecutor

620
00:24:31,070 --> 00:24:33,100
is like a patient to a surgeon.

621
00:24:33,590 --> 00:24:35,550
Once all the indicators
for surgery are met,

622
00:24:35,550 --> 00:24:36,920
you perform the operation.

623
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:39,310
You don't ask the patient
what they're thinking.

624
00:24:39,310 --> 00:24:41,400
Otherwise, you really can't do this job.

625
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:42,400
Mentor, I feel...

626
00:24:43,270 --> 00:24:44,400
I feel this is wrong.

627
00:24:47,550 --> 00:24:48,550
If we prosecutors

628
00:24:48,550 --> 00:24:49,680
don't pour our emotions

629
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:51,160
into our own work,

630
00:24:52,440 --> 00:24:54,170
wouldn't we just become tools?

631
00:24:54,380 --> 00:24:55,720
Prosecutors are the symbol of

632
00:24:55,720 --> 00:24:57,200
the pursuit of fairness and justice.

633
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:59,320
How does this fairness
and justice come about?

634
00:24:59,320 --> 00:24:59,960
It comes from us

635
00:24:59,960 --> 00:25:00,610
handling cases

636
00:25:00,610 --> 00:25:01,480
one by one.

637
00:25:04,880 --> 00:25:05,680
Alright then.

638
00:25:06,310 --> 00:25:07,280
Just go ahead.

639
00:25:07,550 --> 00:25:09,160
But don't get too invested.

640
00:25:10,270 --> 00:25:11,480
Why am I telling you this?

641
00:25:11,480 --> 00:25:11,960
Because

642
00:25:12,520 --> 00:25:13,070
there was a female comrade

643
00:25:13,070 --> 00:25:14,270
in our office before.

644
00:25:15,010 --> 00:25:16,070
She kept getting assigned

645
00:25:16,070 --> 00:25:17,870
these brutally horrific cases.

646
00:25:18,270 --> 00:25:19,470
She was so committed.

647
00:25:20,070 --> 00:25:21,270
And after all those cases

648
00:25:21,270 --> 00:25:22,000
were closed,

649
00:25:22,590 --> 00:25:24,120
she had a mental breakdown.

650
00:25:24,440 --> 00:25:26,100
She's still on medical leave.

651
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:27,920
That won't happen to me.

652
00:25:27,920 --> 00:25:28,510
Don't worry.

653
00:25:28,510 --> 00:25:29,970
My mind's not gonna break.

654
00:25:30,960 --> 00:25:32,270
I have to see what's wrong

655
00:25:32,270 --> 00:25:33,800
with these people's minds.

656
00:25:37,960 --> 00:25:39,020
Okay, that's good.

657
00:25:44,270 --> 00:25:46,270
That Tian Shuzhen is pretty,

658
00:25:46,510 --> 00:25:47,710
and she attracts men.

659
00:25:47,960 --> 00:25:48,920
The business across the street

660
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:49,640
was all taken by her.

661
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:50,570
No, Director Du.

662
00:25:50,790 --> 00:25:52,400
You can't say that.

663
00:25:53,440 --> 00:25:54,970
Everyone around here knows

664
00:25:55,590 --> 00:25:57,400
that Wang's family got pushed out by them,

665
00:25:57,400 --> 00:25:59,070
that they couldn't even make ends meet.

666
00:25:59,070 --> 00:26:01,030
With an eight-year-old kid at home,

667
00:26:01,030 --> 00:26:02,240
but to live on air?

668
00:26:02,550 --> 00:26:04,880
His wife, Liang Yuemin,

669
00:26:05,200 --> 00:26:06,310
is very capable.

670
00:26:06,610 --> 00:26:08,010
Carried the whole family

671
00:26:08,110 --> 00:26:09,350
on her shoulders.

672
00:26:09,880 --> 00:26:10,880
Good woman,

673
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:11,860
warm-hearted.

674
00:26:12,030 --> 00:26:13,750
But she's got a temper.

675
00:26:14,270 --> 00:26:15,830
And her husband Wang Youxi

676
00:26:16,240 --> 00:26:17,200
is spineless.

677
00:26:17,590 --> 00:26:18,520
Plus, I heard...

678
00:26:19,660 --> 00:26:21,840
I heard he's impotent.

679
00:26:22,400 --> 00:26:23,070
That's why

680
00:26:23,310 --> 00:26:24,640
he's afraid of his wife.

681
00:26:26,070 --> 00:26:26,800
Director Du.

682
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:28,120
You're here.

683
00:26:28,120 --> 00:26:29,550
-Director.
-You're here.

684
00:26:29,550 --> 00:26:30,350
Perfect timing.

685
00:26:30,350 --> 00:26:32,200
These are comrades from the Procuratorate.

686
00:26:32,200 --> 00:26:33,960
They are here for the matter

687
00:26:33,980 --> 00:26:35,980
between Wang's and Sun's families.

688
00:26:36,310 --> 00:26:37,880
Hurry up and tell them

689
00:26:38,030 --> 00:26:39,230
what you saw that day.

690
00:26:39,510 --> 00:26:40,770
I've said it 800 times.

691
00:26:40,920 --> 00:26:42,320
What else is there to say?

692
00:26:42,530 --> 00:26:43,310
Just tell them

693
00:26:43,310 --> 00:26:44,510
what you saw that day.

694
00:26:44,590 --> 00:26:45,650
All that pale skin.

695
00:26:46,140 --> 00:26:47,550
You were all there that day, right?

696
00:26:47,550 --> 00:26:48,920
Yes, of course we were.

697
00:26:49,050 --> 00:26:50,170
It would be a loss

698
00:26:50,200 --> 00:26:51,240
to miss such a big drama.

699
00:26:51,240 --> 00:26:52,260
We've been talking about this

700
00:26:52,260 --> 00:26:53,550
over meals for days.

701
00:26:55,270 --> 00:26:56,720
I heard your wife even

702
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:58,350
fought with you over this.

703
00:26:58,350 --> 00:26:59,550
Well, I mean,

704
00:26:59,570 --> 00:27:00,750
everyone's been saying

705
00:27:00,750 --> 00:27:02,550
that Sun Rong's wife is a looker.

706
00:27:02,680 --> 00:27:03,300
Indeed.

707
00:27:03,960 --> 00:27:04,960
She has a really good figure.

708
00:27:04,960 --> 00:27:06,030
I meant it as a compliment.

709
00:27:06,030 --> 00:27:07,480
A-And she got mad.

710
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:08,550
True.

711
00:27:08,880 --> 00:27:09,940
She's much better than your wife.

712
00:27:09,940 --> 00:27:11,000
Why you gotta bring my wife into it?

713
00:27:11,000 --> 00:27:11,810
What's my wife got to do with this?

714
00:27:11,810 --> 00:27:12,670
Stop fighting.

715
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:13,480
What're you getting worked up for?

716
00:27:13,480 --> 00:27:14,070
Stop.

717
00:27:14,440 --> 00:27:15,000
What?

718
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:22,880
Chen,

719
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:25,410
don't stoop to their level.

720
00:27:25,700 --> 00:27:26,200
Let me apologize

721
00:27:26,200 --> 00:27:26,790
on their behalf, okay?

722
00:27:26,790 --> 00:27:28,650
Why are you apologizing for them?

723
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:30,510
I actually grew up

724
00:27:30,510 --> 00:27:31,370
on this street.

725
00:27:32,110 --> 00:27:33,790
These people are indeed rogues,

726
00:27:33,790 --> 00:27:35,250
but I can understand them.

727
00:27:35,480 --> 00:27:36,880
They are poorly educated

728
00:27:37,110 --> 00:27:38,710
and have no other joy in life.

729
00:27:39,000 --> 00:27:39,750
A neighbor's troubles

730
00:27:39,750 --> 00:27:41,080
is half a year's gossip.

731
00:27:41,880 --> 00:27:42,680
Besides, this time

732
00:27:42,680 --> 00:27:44,410
a woman was stripped in public.

733
00:27:45,240 --> 00:27:47,300
I'm telling you, don't make excuses.

734
00:27:47,480 --> 00:27:48,680
When this happened,

735
00:27:48,680 --> 00:27:49,480
not a single person on the street

736
00:27:49,480 --> 00:27:50,680
stepped in to stop it.

737
00:27:51,960 --> 00:27:53,480
So what if they are poorly educated?

738
00:27:53,480 --> 00:27:54,480
Is that an excuse?

739
00:27:54,830 --> 00:27:55,420
I'm telling you,

740
00:27:55,420 --> 00:27:56,680
everyone who was watching that day

741
00:27:56,680 --> 00:27:57,680
is an accomplice.

742
00:27:58,310 --> 00:27:59,480
But we can't prosecute

743
00:27:59,480 --> 00:28:00,680
all those hundreds of people, can we?

744
00:28:00,680 --> 00:28:02,480
So it all has to be pinned on them!

745
00:28:03,070 --> 00:28:04,550
Chen, calm down.

746
00:28:08,550 --> 00:28:10,550
Sorry, it has nothing to do with you.

747
00:28:11,070 --> 00:28:12,920
Let's grab some noodles before going back.

748
00:28:12,920 --> 00:28:14,680
The cafeteria is closed anyway.

749
00:28:14,680 --> 00:28:15,470
I'm not eating.

750
00:28:15,470 --> 00:28:16,280
What? Why?

751
00:28:18,440 --> 00:28:20,570
I won't eat anything from this street.

752
00:28:23,640 --> 00:28:24,640
Song Xiaoguang.

753
00:28:24,880 --> 00:28:25,200
Yes.

754
00:28:26,280 --> 00:28:27,310
In his current condition,

755
00:28:27,310 --> 00:28:29,170
he's not available for visitors.

756
00:28:30,550 --> 00:28:31,290
He doesn't need to see me.

757
00:28:31,290 --> 00:28:32,690
I just want to take a look.

758
00:28:32,790 --> 00:28:33,880
Then what is the purpose

759
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:34,750
of you taking a look?

760
00:28:34,750 --> 00:28:36,750
Taking a look is the purpose itself.

761
00:28:40,070 --> 00:28:40,750
Xiaowen.

762
00:28:41,400 --> 00:28:43,330
How is Song Xiaoguang doing today?

763
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:45,930
He just finished his treatment

764
00:28:46,000 --> 00:28:47,860
and was injected with midazolam.

765
00:28:47,920 --> 00:28:48,920
He's resting now.

766
00:28:49,270 --> 00:28:49,820
Look.

767
00:28:49,920 --> 00:28:50,440
It's

768
00:28:50,440 --> 00:28:51,240
unfortunate.

769
00:28:51,510 --> 00:28:53,280
Why don't you come back another day?

770
00:28:53,280 --> 00:28:53,960
Director Zhao, here's the thing:

771
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:54,750
I'd like to ask—

772
00:28:54,750 --> 00:28:56,550
your prescription forms,

773
00:28:56,750 --> 00:28:57,510
treatment records,

774
00:28:57,510 --> 00:28:58,220
and medication records

775
00:28:58,220 --> 00:28:59,640
are all kept on file, right?

776
00:28:59,640 --> 00:29:00,300
Of course.

777
00:29:00,460 --> 00:29:02,070
We're responsible to our patients.

778
00:29:02,070 --> 00:29:02,510
Understood.

779
00:29:02,510 --> 00:29:03,370
Make sure they're preserved well.

780
00:29:03,370 --> 00:29:05,100
They might come in handy later.

781
00:29:05,240 --> 00:29:07,120
If there is any inaccuracy or fabrication,

782
00:29:07,120 --> 00:29:07,920
the relevant personnel

783
00:29:07,920 --> 00:29:09,960
will be prosecuted for forging evidence.

784
00:29:09,960 --> 00:29:11,250
If convicted,

785
00:29:11,440 --> 00:29:13,370
they'll face legal consequences.

786
00:29:13,880 --> 00:29:14,830
At that time,

787
00:29:14,830 --> 00:29:15,790
it's very likely

788
00:29:15,810 --> 00:29:16,730
our court will reopen

789
00:29:16,730 --> 00:29:18,130
a new medical appraisal.

790
00:29:18,960 --> 00:29:19,680
I've said too much.

791
00:29:19,680 --> 00:29:20,240
You go ahead.

792
00:29:20,240 --> 00:29:20,770
Let's go.

793
00:29:21,550 --> 00:29:22,520
Comrade.

794
00:29:23,480 --> 00:29:24,080
Comrade.

795
00:29:24,830 --> 00:29:25,360
Comrade.

796
00:29:27,510 --> 00:29:28,680
How about this?

797
00:29:30,160 --> 00:29:31,160
Please follow me.

798
00:29:32,520 --> 00:29:34,000
Sorry for the trouble, Director Zhao.

799
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:34,600
Thank you.

800
00:29:41,960 --> 00:29:42,590
Come in.

801
00:29:49,360 --> 00:29:50,110
It's quite narrow.

802
00:29:50,110 --> 00:29:50,710
It's fine.

803
00:29:59,830 --> 00:30:00,490
We're here.

804
00:30:00,720 --> 00:30:01,250
This way.

805
00:30:11,270 --> 00:30:11,750
Mom.

806
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:14,170
Here, have a bite.

807
00:30:16,240 --> 00:30:17,440
This is how she is now.

808
00:30:18,070 --> 00:30:18,920
It's so hot,

809
00:30:20,110 --> 00:30:20,920
but she wraps herself up tightly

810
00:30:20,920 --> 00:30:22,350
with clothes every day.

811
00:30:22,960 --> 00:30:23,400
Look,

812
00:30:23,830 --> 00:30:26,290
she is still covered
with such a thick quilt.

813
00:30:26,400 --> 00:30:27,800
She doesn't eat or drink.

814
00:30:29,240 --> 00:30:31,040
I'm worried that if this goes on,

815
00:30:33,350 --> 00:30:34,480
she won't live long.

816
00:30:35,470 --> 00:30:36,600
How about sending her to the hospital?

817
00:30:36,600 --> 00:30:37,300
We did.

818
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:39,640
She couldn't stay there.

819
00:30:40,750 --> 00:30:42,400
She made a fuss in the hospital.

820
00:30:42,400 --> 00:30:44,000
She spat at strangers

821
00:30:44,020 --> 00:30:44,750
and howled.

822
00:30:45,590 --> 00:30:47,520
The doctors couldn't do anything.

823
00:30:47,750 --> 00:30:48,280
Besides,

824
00:30:49,510 --> 00:30:51,110
we really have no money left.

825
00:30:51,510 --> 00:30:54,170
Get her treated first.
You can claim it all back.

826
00:30:54,280 --> 00:30:55,160
Claim from him?

827
00:30:55,750 --> 00:30:57,200
What can he compensate with?

828
00:30:57,200 --> 00:30:58,610
If his family had money,

829
00:30:58,640 --> 00:30:59,790
would they fight with us for business

830
00:30:59,790 --> 00:31:01,070
and cause all this mess?

831
00:31:01,070 --> 00:31:03,070
He has to compensate no matter what.

832
00:31:03,110 --> 00:31:04,570
I'm putting my words here.

833
00:31:04,730 --> 00:31:05,960
Even if he has to sell everything he owns,

834
00:31:05,960 --> 00:31:07,290
he must compensate you.

835
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:11,510
She is ruined.

836
00:31:13,200 --> 00:31:14,530
Even if he compensates,

837
00:31:14,790 --> 00:31:15,720
can he compensate me

838
00:31:15,720 --> 00:31:16,980
with a healthy person?

839
00:31:19,350 --> 00:31:20,000
That day,

840
00:31:20,960 --> 00:31:21,920
if my son hadn't

841
00:31:22,510 --> 00:31:23,590
held me back with all his might

842
00:31:23,590 --> 00:31:24,850
and snatched my knife,

843
00:31:25,030 --> 00:31:26,510
I would really have chopped up

844
00:31:26,510 --> 00:31:27,840
Wang Youxi and his wife.

845
00:31:32,050 --> 00:31:32,790
I'll do it.

846
00:31:33,030 --> 00:31:33,400
Mom.

847
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:34,060
Move aside.

848
00:31:34,350 --> 00:31:35,240
Mom, it's okay.

849
00:31:35,680 --> 00:31:36,070
Mom.

850
00:31:36,160 --> 00:31:37,090
Don't be afraid.

851
00:31:37,110 --> 00:31:37,870
It's okay.

852
00:31:38,070 --> 00:31:39,210
Don't be afraid.

853
00:31:39,310 --> 00:31:40,070
It's me.

854
00:31:40,200 --> 00:31:40,590
I'm here.

855
00:31:40,590 --> 00:31:42,050
-Mom.
-I'm here. I'm here.

856
00:31:43,880 --> 00:31:44,270
Go get

857
00:31:45,880 --> 00:31:46,510
the rope!

858
00:31:46,530 --> 00:31:47,590
It's okay. Don't be afraid.

859
00:31:47,590 --> 00:31:48,520
Don't be afraid.

860
00:31:48,750 --> 00:31:50,210
Don't be afraid. I'm here.

861
00:32:21,550 --> 00:32:22,480
Write this down.

862
00:32:23,240 --> 00:32:23,830
Sofa.

863
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:25,730
Fruit knife.

864
00:32:27,000 --> 00:32:27,730
Cigarettes.

865
00:32:38,510 --> 00:32:39,000
Yu.

866
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:40,880
Yu, Yu.

867
00:32:41,180 --> 00:32:42,680
You can't tell anything from this at all.

868
00:32:42,680 --> 00:32:43,680
That's exactly why

869
00:32:43,680 --> 00:32:46,080
we need to reopen the appraisal procedure.

870
00:32:48,790 --> 00:32:49,990
Comrade Prosecutor,

871
00:32:50,110 --> 00:32:51,510
I am really a good person.

872
00:32:51,960 --> 00:32:53,460
I haven't done anything bad,

873
00:32:53,460 --> 00:32:54,160
And in business,

874
00:32:54,160 --> 00:32:55,160
I never cheat on measurements.

875
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:56,110
Ask anyone around here

876
00:32:56,110 --> 00:32:57,550
if you don't believe me.

877
00:32:57,790 --> 00:32:58,960
Never done anything wrong?

878
00:32:58,960 --> 00:33:00,030
On the street,

879
00:33:00,520 --> 00:33:01,790
in front of so many people,

880
00:33:01,790 --> 00:33:02,610
you molested a woman.

881
00:33:02,610 --> 00:33:04,030
What else do you want to do?

882
00:33:04,030 --> 00:33:05,400
She pushed me to it!

883
00:33:05,880 --> 00:33:07,510
All I did was rip off her clothes.

884
00:33:07,510 --> 00:33:09,040
What did she do to my family,

885
00:33:09,270 --> 00:33:10,110
did you ask?

886
00:33:11,760 --> 00:33:13,240
I was coming back from grocery shopping,

887
00:33:13,240 --> 00:33:14,400
and I saw my wife

888
00:33:14,400 --> 00:33:15,130
and my sister

889
00:33:15,160 --> 00:33:16,750
fighting with Tian Shuzhen.

890
00:33:16,750 --> 00:33:17,880
Then what did you do?

891
00:33:19,480 --> 00:33:20,340
What did you do?

892
00:33:23,720 --> 00:33:24,630
Excuse me.

893
00:33:24,960 --> 00:33:25,560
Excuse me.

894
00:33:25,790 --> 00:33:26,400
Excuse me.

895
00:33:27,830 --> 00:33:28,270
Move.

896
00:33:28,790 --> 00:33:29,510
What are you doing?

897
00:33:29,510 --> 00:33:30,110
What did you do?

898
00:33:30,110 --> 00:33:31,110
Are you trying to kill her?

899
00:33:31,110 --> 00:33:32,640
Why are you taking her side?

900
00:33:33,200 --> 00:33:33,720
Are you crazy?

901
00:33:33,720 --> 00:33:34,960
What nonsense are you talking about?

902
00:33:34,960 --> 00:33:36,310
Who's talking nonsense?

903
00:33:36,310 --> 00:33:36,790
Go.

904
00:33:37,440 --> 00:33:38,520
Strip her naked.

905
00:33:38,960 --> 00:33:39,400
Do it!

906
00:33:57,150 --> 00:33:58,750
You shouldn't bully people!

907
00:34:00,200 --> 00:34:01,550
I just thought

908
00:34:01,590 --> 00:34:03,270
it was only stripping her clothes off.

909
00:34:03,270 --> 00:34:04,640
I really didn't know.

910
00:34:05,830 --> 00:34:07,230
Our business was booming

911
00:34:07,590 --> 00:34:08,840
before their family

912
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:12,280
opened a restaurant.

913
00:34:13,070 --> 00:34:13,530
Yuemin.

914
00:34:14,230 --> 00:34:14,850
Youxi.

915
00:34:15,070 --> 00:34:15,400
Here.

916
00:34:15,690 --> 00:34:16,620
I bought you some

917
00:34:16,630 --> 00:34:17,670
loquats and pastries.

918
00:34:17,670 --> 00:34:18,510
They're very sweet.

919
00:34:18,510 --> 00:34:19,070
Take them.

920
00:34:19,070 --> 00:34:20,340
Hope you'll look out for us.

921
00:34:20,340 --> 00:34:21,270
Here, take them.

922
00:34:21,440 --> 00:34:22,090
They're delicious.

923
00:34:22,090 --> 00:34:23,000
Listen to me.

924
00:34:23,630 --> 00:34:25,790
There are only so many people
on our street.

925
00:34:25,790 --> 00:34:26,730
If we open two restaurants,

926
00:34:26,730 --> 00:34:28,000
don't you think this business

927
00:34:28,000 --> 00:34:29,070
will be hard to run?

928
00:34:29,090 --> 00:34:30,110
Yuemin, don't worry.

929
00:34:30,110 --> 00:34:31,420
We definitely won't steal your business.

930
00:34:31,420 --> 00:34:32,219
Rest assured.

931
00:34:32,590 --> 00:34:33,400
Here, take them.

932
00:34:33,400 --> 00:34:34,480
They're really sweet.

933
00:34:34,480 --> 00:34:36,070
If you like them, I'll buy you more.

934
00:34:36,070 --> 00:34:37,469
Youxi, I'm heading back.

935
00:34:37,710 --> 00:34:38,510
Enjoy.

936
00:34:39,679 --> 00:34:40,540
She swore to me,

937
00:34:40,550 --> 00:34:41,679
over and over again,

938
00:34:42,440 --> 00:34:44,440
that she'd never poach my business.

939
00:34:44,800 --> 00:34:45,860
But what happened?

940
00:34:46,840 --> 00:34:48,480
She stole my customers!

941
00:34:50,670 --> 00:34:51,199
And then,

942
00:34:53,330 --> 00:34:54,960
she got even bolder.

943
00:34:56,070 --> 00:34:57,320
We were delivering meals

944
00:34:57,320 --> 00:34:58,710
to a construction site.

945
00:34:59,070 --> 00:35:00,840
She took that contract too.

946
00:35:01,110 --> 00:35:01,910
Liang Yuemin.

947
00:35:03,440 --> 00:35:04,800
You are also a woman.

948
00:35:05,440 --> 00:35:07,570
You should understand how that feels.

949
00:35:07,670 --> 00:35:09,150
And you still stripped her in public

950
00:35:09,150 --> 00:35:10,070
and humiliated her?

951
00:35:10,070 --> 00:35:10,440
Yes,

952
00:35:11,440 --> 00:35:12,240
that's right.

953
00:35:12,920 --> 00:35:15,000
I am also a woman.

954
00:35:15,550 --> 00:35:16,510
Then how can I

955
00:35:16,920 --> 00:35:18,710
make a living with my own two hands,

956
00:35:18,710 --> 00:35:19,960
but she has to rely on

957
00:35:20,320 --> 00:35:21,280
seducing men?

958
00:35:21,760 --> 00:35:23,080
Tian Shuzhen is now

959
00:35:23,110 --> 00:35:24,240
mentally unstable.

960
00:35:24,320 --> 00:35:25,970
Your family did this to her.

961
00:35:26,000 --> 00:35:26,800
You know that?

962
00:35:27,030 --> 00:35:27,960
She's faking it.

963
00:35:29,880 --> 00:35:30,810
She's faking it.

964
00:35:31,550 --> 00:35:32,760
I have an eight-year-old son.

965
00:35:32,760 --> 00:35:33,380
I want...

966
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:37,930
I beg you to give me another chance.

967
00:35:38,590 --> 00:35:40,320
She pushed me to it.

968
00:35:42,280 --> 00:35:43,440
She forced me.

969
00:35:43,590 --> 00:35:45,140
She brought it on herself.

970
00:35:49,150 --> 00:35:50,810
Didn't you try to talk to them?

971
00:35:52,000 --> 00:35:53,230
Talk to them about what?

972
00:35:53,230 --> 00:35:54,960
Persuade them to show remorse.

973
00:35:55,440 --> 00:35:56,230
Get them to offer

974
00:35:56,230 --> 00:35:57,210
as much compensation as possible,

975
00:35:57,210 --> 00:35:58,920
and try to get the victim's forgiveness.

976
00:35:58,920 --> 00:35:59,510
That would help

977
00:35:59,510 --> 00:36:00,360
when it comes to

978
00:36:00,360 --> 00:36:01,090
sentencing.

979
00:36:01,440 --> 00:36:02,440
Even now, he doesn't think

980
00:36:02,440 --> 00:36:03,640
he committed a crime.

981
00:36:03,800 --> 00:36:05,000
Where is the remorse?

982
00:36:05,190 --> 00:36:06,590
Where is the compensation?

983
00:36:06,590 --> 00:36:07,280
Besides, why should the victim

984
00:36:07,280 --> 00:36:08,120
forgive them?

985
00:36:08,280 --> 00:36:09,230
But you haven't tried,

986
00:36:09,230 --> 00:36:10,190
how do you know?

987
00:36:10,670 --> 00:36:11,760
The victim's son is

988
00:36:11,760 --> 00:36:12,840
twelve or thirteen years old.

989
00:36:12,840 --> 00:36:14,100
Right at his doorstep,

990
00:36:14,200 --> 00:36:15,360
he witnessed his mother

991
00:36:15,360 --> 00:36:17,230
being publicly humiliated

992
00:36:17,880 --> 00:36:19,230
and bullied by neighbors.

993
00:36:19,230 --> 00:36:20,290
How can he forgive?

994
00:36:21,320 --> 00:36:22,630
That kid walks past this spot

995
00:36:22,630 --> 00:36:24,110
every day going to and from school.

996
00:36:24,110 --> 00:36:25,640
How can he ever forget that?

997
00:36:25,920 --> 00:36:27,180
Why should he forgive?

998
00:36:27,800 --> 00:36:28,360
Chen,

999
00:36:29,370 --> 00:36:31,440
we can't make decisions for the victim

1000
00:36:31,440 --> 00:36:32,760
to express forgiveness.

1001
00:36:32,760 --> 00:36:33,590
Likewise, we cannot

1002
00:36:33,590 --> 00:36:34,800
make decisions for the victim

1003
00:36:34,800 --> 00:36:37,320
-to refuse forgiveness.
-Yes, that's right.

1004
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:38,800
I know you're right about everything.

1005
00:36:38,800 --> 00:36:39,920
But on this matter,

1006
00:36:40,510 --> 00:36:41,510
I can't accept it.

1007
00:36:43,590 --> 00:36:44,510
Do you know what the cruelest war

1008
00:36:44,510 --> 00:36:46,070
in the world is?

1009
00:36:47,200 --> 00:36:48,200
The cruelest war

1010
00:36:48,230 --> 00:36:49,120
is when people

1011
00:36:49,400 --> 00:36:51,200
harm each other just to survive.

1012
00:36:51,680 --> 00:36:52,630
Don't you think Liang Yuemin's family

1013
00:36:52,630 --> 00:36:53,980
is actually quite pitiful too?

1014
00:36:53,980 --> 00:36:55,240
These are all excuses.

1015
00:36:57,480 --> 00:36:58,610
And I don't think so.

1016
00:37:00,070 --> 00:37:01,600
Aren't these just excuses?

1017
00:37:01,840 --> 00:37:02,590
Just because you need to survive,

1018
00:37:02,590 --> 00:37:03,720
you can harm others?

1019
00:37:04,550 --> 00:37:06,010
What kind of logic is that?

1020
00:37:09,680 --> 00:37:10,410
If you think

1021
00:37:10,440 --> 00:37:12,200
you have to hurt others to survive,

1022
00:37:12,200 --> 00:37:12,940
then let me tell you,

1023
00:37:12,940 --> 00:37:15,340
if you commit a crime,
you must be punished.

1024
00:37:16,840 --> 00:37:17,480
When I was young,

1025
00:37:17,480 --> 00:37:18,740
I said the same things.

1026
00:37:18,760 --> 00:37:19,920
When you get older,

1027
00:37:19,920 --> 00:37:20,570
you will understand

1028
00:37:20,570 --> 00:37:24,300
that what ought to be and what actually is
are two different things.

1029
00:37:26,550 --> 00:37:27,880
Mentor, if I...

1030
00:37:29,630 --> 00:37:30,880
If one day,

1031
00:37:32,400 --> 00:37:34,000
I encounter something like this

1032
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:36,000
and I don't even feel angry anymore,

1033
00:37:36,030 --> 00:37:37,160
don't even feel sad,

1034
00:37:39,150 --> 00:37:39,950
then I'm done.

1035
00:37:48,030 --> 00:37:48,590
So have you decided?

1036
00:37:48,590 --> 00:37:49,640
What sentence are you planning

1037
00:37:49,640 --> 00:37:51,100
to recommend to the court?

1038
00:37:52,080 --> 00:37:52,960
The National People's Congress

1039
00:37:52,960 --> 00:37:54,160
has clear provisions

1040
00:37:54,480 --> 00:37:56,140
on the Strike-Hard Campaign.

1041
00:37:57,630 --> 00:37:59,480
For crimes with severe circumstances,

1042
00:37:59,480 --> 00:38:01,940
sentencing can exceed the statutory range.

1043
00:38:02,360 --> 00:38:02,920
Look, you've been here

1044
00:38:02,920 --> 00:38:03,570
for a long time.

1045
00:38:03,570 --> 00:38:04,590
Cases of sentencing above

1046
00:38:04,590 --> 00:38:06,590
the statutory range have been rare.

1047
00:38:06,590 --> 00:38:07,360
But this provision

1048
00:38:07,360 --> 00:38:08,690
hasn't been abolished.

1049
00:38:08,880 --> 00:38:10,090
We can still use it.

1050
00:38:11,280 --> 00:38:12,070
In this case,

1051
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:14,710
I will definitely do my best

1052
00:38:15,550 --> 00:38:17,810
to give them the most severe punishment.

1053
00:38:19,760 --> 00:38:20,400
That day,

1054
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:21,460
after dawn,

1055
00:38:22,030 --> 00:38:23,290
I was walking this way,

1056
00:38:23,590 --> 00:38:25,320
and I saw something over there.

1057
00:38:26,000 --> 00:38:27,400
I was wondering about it.

1058
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:29,630
I was wondering who dropped their stuff.

1059
00:38:29,630 --> 00:38:30,690
Took a closer look,

1060
00:38:30,920 --> 00:38:32,250
and it was a plastic bag.

1061
00:39:05,510 --> 00:39:06,910
We found something here.

1062
00:39:10,100 --> 00:39:10,840
Excuse me.

1063
00:39:12,100 --> 00:39:12,830
Captain Liu.

1064
00:39:14,590 --> 00:39:15,590
What's the situation?

1065
00:39:15,590 --> 00:39:16,520
Aside from here,

1066
00:39:16,780 --> 00:39:18,000
in the woods across the river,

1067
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:19,260
we found another part.

1068
00:39:32,360 --> 00:39:33,760
Preliminary assessment

1069
00:39:34,070 --> 00:39:36,200
is that it washed up during high water.

1070
00:39:36,920 --> 00:39:37,650
Captain Liu!

1071
00:39:37,710 --> 00:39:38,640
What's going on?

1072
00:39:38,800 --> 00:39:40,060
We found a body in a bag.

1073
00:39:41,630 --> 00:39:42,080
Mom.

1074
00:39:42,920 --> 00:39:43,800
Mom, take it easy.

1075
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:45,130
Slow down. Don't panic.

1076
00:39:45,560 --> 00:39:46,820
It might not be Sanhua.

1077
00:39:51,840 --> 00:39:52,970
This is Captain Liu.

1078
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:54,010
Captain,

1079
00:39:54,630 --> 00:39:55,830
where is my daughter?

1080
00:39:55,920 --> 00:39:57,480
Ma'am, please calm down.

1081
00:39:58,220 --> 00:39:59,420
We haven't confirmed

1082
00:39:59,590 --> 00:40:01,190
that it's your daughter yet.

1083
00:40:01,360 --> 00:40:01,960
Please, have a seat.

1084
00:40:01,960 --> 00:40:02,360
Right.

1085
00:40:02,760 --> 00:40:04,320
Mom, sit down.

1086
00:40:07,190 --> 00:40:08,050
How about this?

1087
00:40:08,630 --> 00:40:09,670
Tell me first

1088
00:40:10,190 --> 00:40:11,390
about your daughter.

1089
00:40:11,710 --> 00:40:12,480
My daughter

1090
00:40:12,880 --> 00:40:14,740
suddenly stopped contacting us.

1091
00:40:14,920 --> 00:40:16,000
I'm so worried.

1092
00:40:16,480 --> 00:40:17,590
My eyelids

1093
00:40:17,610 --> 00:40:19,530
just keep twitching nonstop.

1094
00:40:20,590 --> 00:40:22,510
And I've been having dreams lately.

1095
00:40:22,510 --> 00:40:24,310
My daughter came to me in a dream.

1096
00:40:24,710 --> 00:40:25,820
She said her husband

1097
00:40:25,820 --> 00:40:26,490
killed her

1098
00:40:26,680 --> 00:40:28,280
and threw her into the water.

1099
00:40:43,480 --> 00:40:44,280
Stop weaving.

1100
00:40:44,550 --> 00:40:46,000
It's not worth much.

1101
00:40:50,230 --> 00:40:51,030
What's wrong?

1102
00:40:56,600 --> 00:40:58,200
Hasn't your foot healed yet?

1103
00:41:16,360 --> 00:41:16,890
Comrade.

1104
00:41:17,920 --> 00:41:19,650
You are Qian Xingliang, right?

1105
00:41:20,630 --> 00:41:21,400
Ten days ago,

1106
00:41:22,150 --> 00:41:23,000
specifically on August

1107
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:24,120
11th or 12th,

1108
00:41:24,150 --> 00:41:25,010
where were you?

1109
00:41:27,480 --> 00:41:28,480
I can't remember.

1110
00:41:29,230 --> 00:41:29,960
I don't think

1111
00:41:31,110 --> 00:41:32,040
I went anywhere.

1112
00:41:33,590 --> 00:41:35,070
Your wife, Yu Sanhua,

1113
00:41:35,070 --> 00:41:36,840
came to see you recently, didn't she?

1114
00:41:36,840 --> 00:41:37,570
Yes, she did.

1115
00:41:38,840 --> 00:41:39,670
I heard

1116
00:41:40,840 --> 00:41:42,150
you asked her to come.

1117
00:41:42,650 --> 00:41:43,110
Yes.

1118
00:41:44,030 --> 00:41:45,560
I had someone pass a message

1119
00:41:46,590 --> 00:41:48,320
to talk to her about something.

1120
00:41:49,670 --> 00:41:50,360
So,

1121
00:41:51,470 --> 00:41:53,600
what did you ask her to come talk about?

1122
00:41:53,710 --> 00:41:54,640
Divorce.

1123
00:41:55,410 --> 00:41:56,480
She was working in Guangzhou,

1124
00:41:56,480 --> 00:41:57,360
and had a lover,

1125
00:41:57,570 --> 00:41:59,100
so she wanted to divorce me.

1126
00:41:59,400 --> 00:42:00,510
I said fine,

1127
00:42:01,160 --> 00:42:01,920
but you have to return

1128
00:42:01,920 --> 00:42:03,480
the 2,000 yuan bride price.

1129
00:42:04,150 --> 00:42:05,480
Otherwise, no divorce.

1130
00:42:11,460 --> 00:42:12,860
Did you talk in this room?

1131
00:42:14,230 --> 00:42:14,710
No.

1132
00:42:15,510 --> 00:42:16,240
By the river.

1133
00:42:17,480 --> 00:42:19,010
I didn't want my mom to hear.

1134
00:42:22,110 --> 00:42:23,010
How did it go?

1135
00:42:23,480 --> 00:42:24,280
It went badly.

1136
00:42:25,230 --> 00:42:26,030
We had a fight.

1137
00:42:26,510 --> 00:42:26,970
She said

1138
00:42:27,440 --> 00:42:28,960
that unless I got a divorce,

1139
00:42:28,960 --> 00:42:30,360
I'd never see her again.

1140
00:42:30,920 --> 00:42:31,480
And then?

1141
00:42:32,420 --> 00:42:33,750
How did she go back?

1142
00:42:36,190 --> 00:42:37,920
She walked along the main road.

1143
00:42:38,030 --> 00:42:38,920
She probably

1144
00:42:39,710 --> 00:42:41,190
took the bus back.

1145
00:42:42,000 --> 00:42:43,130
I didn't see her off.

1146
00:42:43,710 --> 00:42:44,310
What time?

1147
00:42:46,760 --> 00:42:47,760
I can't remember.

1148
00:42:48,190 --> 00:42:49,650
What did you do after that?

1149
00:42:51,670 --> 00:42:53,630
I played cards with someone

1150
00:42:54,440 --> 00:42:57,030
and didn't go home until dark.
